- Board square 330, fit 390 minus header 50 and margins => 320. Set max-width min(320px, calc(100svh - 70px)) = 320. frame ~310. Start overlay content needs fit.
- Move touch controls? It's inside arena after stage footer, would be under board, but can't fit. We can position touch controls to the right via CSS absolute? Better restructure to have a side panel. Could duplicate controls? No.
- Since .touch-controls is inside arena, we can in landscape make `.arena` a grid with frame and controls side by side? `.arena` contains stage-meta, compact-hud, frame-wrap, mobile-brief, stage-footer, touch-controls. In landscape:
```
.shell { display:flex; flex-direction:row; max-width:840; gap:20; align-items:center; }
